{"instance_id": "q98", "arm": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "config": "c1", "rep": 0, "success": true, "http_status": 200, "error": "", "error_kind": null, "content": "I need to find r* using the Vasicek model properties.\n\nIn the Vasicek model, the bond price has the form:\n$$P(r,t,T) = A(t,T)e^{-B(t,T)r}$$\n\nwhere B(t,T) = (1-e^{-a(T-t)})/a for some parameter a.\n\nKey property: ln P(r,t,T) is linear in r.\n\nLet me denote:\n- P(0.04, 0, 2) = 0.9445, so ln(0.9445) = -0.0571\n- P(0.05, 1, 3) = 0.9321, so ln(0.9321) = -0.0703\n- P(r*, 2, 4) = 0.8960, so ln(0.8960) = -0.1098\n\nFor Vasicek, the bond price formula gives:\n$$\\ln P(r,t,T) = \\ln A(t,T) - B(t,T) \\cdot r$$\n\nThe time intervals are:\n- From t=0 to T=2: duration 2\n- From t=1 to T=3: duration 2\n- From t=2 to T=4: duration 2\n\nAll have the same duration (T-t = 2), so B(t,T) is the same for all three. Let me call it B(2).\n\nSo:\n- ln(0.9445) = ln A(0,2) - B(2)·(0.04)\n- ln(0.9321) = ln A(1,3) - B(2)·(0.05)\n- ln(0.8960) = ln A(2,4) - B(2)·r*\n\nIn Vasicek, A(t,T) depends on t and T, but for the same duration, there's a relationship. Actually, let me use the property that for the same maturity structure, we can find relationships.\n\nLet me compute:\n- ln(0.9445) = -0.05709\n- ln(0.9321) = -0.07032\n- ln(0.8960) = -0.10977\n\nFrom the first two equations (both duration 2):\n-0.05709 = ln A(0,2) - 0.04·B(2)\n-0.07032 = ln A(1,3) - 0.05·B(2)\n\nIn Vasicek, A(t,T) for the same duration varies with t. However, I need another approach.\n\nLet me use the fact that in Vasicek, the yield is affine in r. The yield y = -ln(P)/(T-t).\n\nFor duration 2:\n- y₁ = 0.05709/2 = 0.02855 at r=0.04\n- y₂ = 0.07032/2 = 0.03516 at r=0.05\n- y₃ = 0.10977/2 = 0.05489 at r=r*\n\nSince yield is linear in r: y = α + β·r\n\nFrom first two:\n0.02855 = α + 0.04β\n0.03516 = α + 0.05β\n\nSubtracting: 0.00661 = 0.01β, so β = 0.661\n\nThen α = 0.02855 - 0.04(0.661) = 0.02855 - 0.02644 = 0.00211\n\nFor r*: 0.05489 = 0.00211 + 0.661·r*\nr* = (0.05489 - 0.00211)/0.661 = 0.05278/0.661 = 0.0798 ≈ 0.08\n\nE", "reasoning": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "reasoning_tokens": 0, "tokens_in": 256, "tokens_out": 954, "latency_s": 18.508, "request_datetime": "2026-10-03T11:59:53.017241+00:00", "resp_model": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "params": {"max_tokens": 1024, "temperature": 0.1, "thinking": {"type": "disabled"}}, "arm_name": "longcat-2.5-preview-free", "qid": 98}
